
Contains the complete code to run a reduced version of the dual encoder for matching advertisers to a user

Files:
1. ade_spl_dual_encoder_train_test.py 
Contains the model construction and training code. It gets the toy data from kaggle datasets and creates a vector database with embeddings of the answer set.

2. hnsw_vector_database.py
Defines a vector database with required methods to add entries , find a top K match and to save the database to disk
